      "name": "HD Vanilla Trader Pics",
      "slug": "hd-vanilla-trader-pics",
      "teaser": "Higher resolution vanilla trader pictures.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2065.png",
      "downloads": 7119,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p><strong>Why?</strong></p>\n<p>The trader pictures were distractingly low rez. I did not like the other alternate trader picture mods. I wanted to keep true to the original design, so I took the original pictures and ran them through various upscalers and face generators, then a lot of clean up in Photoshop.</p>\n<p>Now you can see everyone up close. The changes are subtle, but they give them a lot more character.</p>\n<p>I recommend using this with my other mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2096-hide-top-glow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hide Top Glow</a>, otherwise Ragman and Jager will look too bright.</p>\n<p><strong>After installing, you must “Clear Temp Files” in the SPT launcher for the new pictures to show up.</strong></p>\n<p>(Those original pictures in the corners are a true size comparison. (127x127 -&gt; 526x526 )</p>\n<p>Credit to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/163-alternative-trader-pics/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Alternative Trader Pics</a> for the code. You do not need this as a prerequisite though.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1502/hd-vanilla-trader-pics",
